gsECkf12mzb1pGQn7xD9JZ4DD6pfpp2AyOw&oe=6AE48FF1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GX Bible", "keywords": ["Bible", "Biblia", "Book", "Learning"], "long_description": "# GX Bible\n\nGX Bible is a powerful, free Bible reader built natively for Meta Quest \u2014 \nread God's Word in immersive comfort, right in your VR space.\n\n## \ud83d\udcd6 TRANSLATIONS\n- Access 1,000+ Bible translations from around the world\n- Spanish, English, and hundreds of other languages\n- Add or remove translations as you need them\n- Download translations for offline reading \u2014 no internet required\n\n## \u271d\ufe0f READING PLANS\n- Bible in a Year \u2014 read the full Bible in 365 days\n- NT in 90 Days \u2014 focus on the New Testament\n- Track your daily progress and reading streak\n\n## \ud83d\udd0d SEARCH & NAVIGATION\n- Full-text search powered by Typesense\n- Quick navigation by book, chapter and verse reference\n- Jump directly to any verse instantly\n\n## \ud83d\udcdd STUDY TOOLS\n- Highlight verses in 4 colors\n- Add personal notes to any verse\n- Bookmark your favorite verses\n- Full reading history\n\n## \ud83c\udf10 MULTILINGUAL\n- Complete UI in Spanish and English\n- Automatically adapts to your selected translation\n\nGX Bible is free, ad-free, and built with love for the Word of God.", "short_description": "GX Bible is a powerful, free Bible reader built natively for Meta Quest \u2014 \nread God's Word in immersive comfort, right in your VR space."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://guerrero-lab.github.io/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Guerrero Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://guerrero-lab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "exter